{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "bee325bd4e479e95acba4e49b2823f29908deb267df8925d34ca31eecd187f8b", "ja": "うーん、どうしようカナー……。", "zh": "嗯……该怎么办呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_1002_p", "source_sha256": "76eb042cde10aaa9d09707d3af57c7c4eb1bf25ae6dd1b1e6c2d0748dcd460bd", "ja": "（エレナが何か考え事をしているな。\n今日の握手会のことだろうか……？）", "zh": "（艾琳娜似乎在想事情。\n是在烦恼今天的握手会吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "b1b28434bc037b4c5855e8e44e4420bf62ab6b9f1485f4edfe7060733657c10c", "ja": "……あっ、{$P$}！\nちょっとだけ、ワタシの相談に乗ってくれる？", "zh": "……啊，{$P$}！\n可以跟你商量一点事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "401008657522574cd7a68bebc423d27c804f4ffc98fa93066e75534dece67444", "ja": "トークの内容が、全然思いつかないんだヨー。\nファンのみんなと、ちゃんとお話しなきゃダメだよネ？", "zh": "我完全想不到该说些什么啦～\n我得认真和粉丝们说话才对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_1005_p", "source_sha256": "bf4dace0fbf0eaebabf8ea3e3a846bd7a8d9e1a0d75dda00da809960b18285dd", "ja": "あまり気にしすぎなくていいと思うけどな。みんな\nエレナの笑顔が見られれば、十分嬉しいと思うよ。", "zh": "我认为别想太多比较好，\n大家只要能见到艾琳娜的笑容就会很开心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "d95239232af01a09e44ed296c8a148a6d1ddc7b24189698243880c1dc931291c", "ja": "笑顔だけでいいノ？\nそれならワタシにも、できそうだヨー！", "zh": "只要微笑就好了吗？\n这样的话，我也做得到喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "e2bebaaf819475e282ef9e1896a422162ef8ef6124e1e0b7ece6527b8af43924", "ja": "ありがと、{$P$}！\nワタシ、いっぱい笑顔見せてくるネ！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}！\n我去让大家看我满满的笑容啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
